<h2>Viewing Single Client vs. All Clients</h2>

<p>
    You can toggle between two views:
</p>

<h3>Single Client View</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Shows premium data for one specific client</li>
    <li>Useful when analyzing an individual client's portfolio</li>
    <li>Automatically selected when opened from a client record</li>
    <li>Shows just one row in the data grid</li>
</ul>

<h3>All Clients View</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Shows premium data for your entire book of business</li>
    <li>Useful for management reports and overall analysis</li>
    <li>Toggle "Show all clients" to enable this view</li>
    <li>Shows all clients with active policies</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <strong>Note:</strong> If you see an info message, you may need to select a client first or ensure policies exist for the timeframe.
</p>

