<h2>Troubleshooting</h2>

<h3>No Data Showing</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Verify that policies exist in Quickfire with premium amounts entered</li>
    <li>Check that policies have effective and expiration dates within the 12-month window</li>
    <li>Ensure you've selected a client (if viewing single client) or toggled "Show all clients"</li>
    <li>Check the info message for guidance on what's needed</li>
</ul>

<h3>Incorrect Premium Totals</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Verify that premium amounts are entered correctly on policy records</li>
    <li>Check that policies are marked as active and not expired</li>
    <li>Ensure premium values are in the correct currency format</li>
    <li>Review individual policy records to identify discrepancies</li>
</ul>

<h3>Status Message Shows Old Timestamp</h3>
<ul>
    <li>The timestamp shows when the data was last refreshed</li>
    <li>Refresh the page to get the latest data</li>
    <li>The 12-month window is calculated from the current date, not the timestamp</li>
</ul>

<h3>CSV Export Not Working</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Ensure you have data to export (at least one client with policies)</li>
    <li>Check your browser's download settings</li>
    <li>Try a different browser if the download fails</li>
    <li>Verify you have permission to download files</li>
</ul>

